  "ruleText": "Lot 8002.05 “Driver” means the individual who rides or drives a horse as a professional in a race. In thoroughbred racing, the driver is known as a jockey.\n\nSource. (See Revision Note at chapter heading for Lot 8000) #12544, eff 6-1-18",
